## THE DIFF — both hunks, the only change being the masked argument

```diff
@@ arm_pop()   (the LDM slow path)
-			if (!cpu->memory_rw(cpu, cpu->mem, addr, data,
+			/*  #524 (armbdt): [~20 lines of rationale] */
+			if (!cpu->memory_rw(cpu, cpu->mem, addr & 0xfffffffc, data,
