1952:  *  Load Register Exclusive (ARM "load linked"):
1953:  *
1954:  *  A Load Register Exclusive instruction initiates a RMW (read-modify-write)
1955:  *  sequence.
1956:  *
1957:  *  A Store Register Exclusive instruction ends the sequence.
